{
  "id": "PSA.104",
  "number": "104",
  "bookId": "PSA",
  "reference": "Psaumes 104",
  "copyright": "Texte libre de droits",
  "verseCount": 35,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "104",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "PSA 104"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "104",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 104:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mon âme, bénis l'",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.104.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.104.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Éternel",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.104.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.104.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.104.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.104.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Éternel",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.104.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.104.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", mon",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.104.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.104.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Dieu",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.104.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.104.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", tu es merveilleusement grand, tu es revêtu de majesté et de magnificence !",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.104.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.104.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 104:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Il s'enveloppe de lumière comme d'un manteau ; il étend les cieux comme une tenture.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.104.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.104.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 104:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Il joint les poutres de ses chambres hautes dans les eaux ; il fait des nuées son char ; il se promène sur les ailes du vent.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.104.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.104.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 104:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Il fait ses anges des esprits",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.104.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.104.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", et ses serviteurs des flammes de feu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.104.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.104.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 104:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Il a fondé la terre sur ses bases ; elle ne sera point ébranlée, à toujours et à perpétuité.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.104.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.104.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 104:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tu l'avais couverte de l'abîme comme d'un vêtement, les eaux se tenaient au-dessus des montagnes :",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.104.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.104.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 104:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "À ta menace, elles s'enfuirent ; à la voix de ton tonnerre, elles se hâtèrent de fuir : –",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.104.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.104.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 104:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Les montagnes s'élevèrent, les vallées s'abaissèrent, au lieu même que tu leur avais établi ; –",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.104.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.104.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 104:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tu leur as mis une limite qu'elles ne dépasseront point ; elles ne reviendront pas couvrir la terre.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.104.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.104.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 104:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Il a envoyé les sources dans les vallées : elles coulent entre les montagnes ;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.104.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.104.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 104:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elles abreuvent toutes les bêtes des champs ; les ânes sauvages y étanchent leur soif.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.104.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.104.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 104:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Les oiseaux des cieux demeurent auprès d'elles ; ils font résonner leur voix d'entre les branches.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.104.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.104.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 104:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "De ses chambres hautes, il abreuve les montagnes ; la terre est rassasiée du fruit de tes œuvres.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.104.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.104.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 104:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Il fait germer l'herbe pour le bétail, et les plantes pour le service de l'homme, faisant sortir le pain de la terre,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.104.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.104.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 104:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Et le vin qui réjouit le cœur de l'homme, faisant reluire son visage avec l'huile ; et avec le pain il soutient le cœur de l'homme.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.104.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.104.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 104:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Les arbres de l'",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.104.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.104.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Éternel",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.104.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.104.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "sont rassasiés, les cèdres du Liban, qu'il a plantés,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.104.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.104.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 104:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Où les oiseaux font leurs nids. Les pins sont la demeure de la cigogne.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.104.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.104.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 104:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Les hautes montagnes sont pour les bouquetins ; les rochers sont le refuge des damans.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.104.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.104.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 104:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Il a fait la lune pour les saisons ; le soleil connaît son coucher.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.104.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.104.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 104:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tu amènes les ténèbres, et la nuit arrive : alors toutes les bêtes de la forêt sont en mouvement ;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.104.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.104.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 104:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Les lionceaux rugissent après la proie, et pour demander à",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.104.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.104.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "✶Dieu",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.104.21",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.104.21"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "leur nourriture…",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.104.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.104.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 104:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Le soleil se lève : ils se retirent",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.104.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.104.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", et se couchent dans leurs tanières.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.104.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.104.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 104:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "[Alors] l'homme sort à son ouvrage et à son travail, jusqu'au soir.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.104.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.104.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 104:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Que tes œuvres sont nombreuses, ô",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.104.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.104.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Éternel",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.104.24",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.104.24"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "! tu les as toutes faites avec sagesse. La terre est pleine de tes richesses.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.104.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.104.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 104:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cette mer, grande et vaste en tous sens ! Là se meuvent sans nombre des animaux, les petits avec les grands ;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.104.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.104.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 104:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Là se promènent les navires, [là] ce léviathan que tu as formé pour s'y ébattre.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.104.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.104.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 104:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tous s'attendent à toi, afin que tu leur donnes leur nourriture en son temps.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.104.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.104.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 104:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tu leur donnes, ils recueillent ; tu ouvres ta main, ils sont rassasiés de biens.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.104.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.104.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 104:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tu caches ta face, ils sont troublés ; tu retires leur souffle, ils expirent et retournent à leur poussière.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.104.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.104.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 104:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tu envoies ton esprit : ils sont créés, et tu renouvelles la face de la terre",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.104.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.104.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.104.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.104.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 104:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "La gloire de l'",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.104.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.104.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Éternel",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.104.31",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.104.31"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "sera à toujours ; l'",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.104.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.104.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Éternel",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.104.31",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.104.31"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "se réjouira en ses œuvres.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.104.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.104.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 104:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Il regarde vers la terre, et elle tremble ; il touche les montagnes, et elles fument.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.104.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.104.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 104:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Je chanterai à l'",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.104.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.104.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Éternel",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.104.33",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.104.33"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "durant ma vie, je chanterai des cantiques à mon",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.104.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.104.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Dieu",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.104.33",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.104.33"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "tant que j'existerai.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.104.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.104.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 104:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Que ma méditation lui soit agréable ; moi, je me réjouirai en l'",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.104.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.104.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Éternel",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.104.34",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.104.34"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.104.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.104.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 104:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Les pécheurs prendront fin de dessus la terre, et les méchants ne seront plus. Mon âme, bénis l'",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.104.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.104.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Éternel",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.104.35",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.104.35"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "! Louez Jah !",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.104.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.104.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
